114	\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_2:IsAngularMomentumFactor}
115	\lean{IPhO2026.Problem1.B2.IsAngularMomentumFactor}
116	The predicate on a real $\mu$ asserting $\mu > 0$, i.e.\ that $\mu$ is a
117	legitimate dimensionless factor making the per-particle angular momentum
118	$\mu\hbar$ about the centre of mass positive.
119	\end{definition}
